   "t": " the newbie: 'new' plus an ending that turns it into a person. ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "в",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "сторону.",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " to the side, ends in -u because he's sending Max somewhere.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Подвинься давай, я помогу тебе.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Move over, come on, I will help you.' , 'move over', has the reflexive ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Подвинься",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " ending because you move yourself. ",
