  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "давай,",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " tacked on after a command works as a nudge: 'come on'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Федя, спасибо, у меня ничего не получается!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Fedya, thank you, nothing is working out for me!' is literally 'at me nothing comes ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "у",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
