  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " out'. Use it whenever nothing you try works.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Сейчас главное — полностью успокоиться.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Right now the main thing is to completely calm down.' , 'the main thing', is an ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "главное",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
