   "t": "выдох.",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " the prefix for 'out'. The words for breathing in and out share a root, and only the prefix changes.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "И навсегда запомни главное правило.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And forever remember the main rule.' , 'forever', joins 'on' and ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "навсегда",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'always'. ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "запомни",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", 'remember', shares a root with the word for 'memory'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Запара бывает не на кухне.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The rush does not happen in the kitchen.' is kitchen slang for a rush, ",
