   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "кухне.",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " so the 'not' is about the place.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Настоящая запара всегда только в голове!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The real rush is always only in your head!' , 'in the head', has the ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "в",
   "gap": 0.25
